+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"YZ244F116Ng","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Salute - Lionheart","track":{"id":"yFi11L-HUGU","path":"/artists/salute/tracks/lionheart/","slug":"lionheart","title":"Lionheart","artist":{"slug":"salute","title":"salute"},"artwork":"images/artists/salute/tracks/lionheart.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-195"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"IW17InSkb_4","position":72,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Salute - Lionheart","track":{"id":"yFi11L-HUGU","path":"/artists/salute/tracks/lionheart/","slug":"lionheart","title":"Lionheart","artist":{"slug":"salute","title":"salute"},"artwork":"images/artists/salute/tracks/lionheart.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"JzAXADeB_WI","slug":"200","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-200-celebration-of-life"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #200 (Celebration of Life)","artwork":"/images/episodes/200.jpg","conte